TextFold to Zotero
Maintainer: Jakende (https://github.com/Jakende)
Distribution license: GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.

The PDF location code in core.js and sync.js draws on character indexing,
selection geometry and reader integration patterns from LLM-for-Zotero,
maintained by Yile Wang and contributors. Its source was consulted in version
3.9.20, and the implementation here was adapted for TextFold note transfers.

Upstream project: https://github.com/yilewang/llm-for-zotero
Upstream resolver: https://github.com/yilewang/llm-for-zotero/blob/main/src/services/pdf/pdfAnnotationResolver.ts
Upstream license: https://github.com/yilewang/llm-for-zotero/blob/main/LICENSE

TextFold, Zotero, and TextFold Bridge for Obsidian are separate projects.
